  "question": {
    "text": "If \\({ }^{20} \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}={ }^{20} \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}-10}\\) then \\({ }^{18} \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}\\) is equal to"
